# INPUTS THAT CRASH THE REFERENCE (NULL function name reaches strcmp). A
# conforming implementation MUST return failure for each and MUST NOT crash.
# The expected file records "parse crash"; the conformance rule maps that to
# "parse fail" (see test/conformance/README.md).
parse "void 1f()"
parse "void 123()"
parse "void +()"
parse "void \"s\"()"
parse "void ()"
parse "void f("
parse "int 1f(int a)"
